4.3 Typography [PROPOSED]
Font family: Inter (fallback: system-ui, sans-serif). Monospace for codes: JetBrains Mono.
Scale: --text-xs 12px, --text-sm 14px, --text-base 16px, --text-lg 18px, --text-xl 20px, --text-2xl 24px, --text-3xl 30px.
Weights: 400 regular, 500 medium, 600 semibold, 700 bold.
Line height: 1.5 for body, 1.25 for headings.
4.4 Spacing, Radius, Shadow, Motion [PROPOSED]
Spacing scale (4px base): 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64.
Radius: --radius-sm 4px, --radius-md 8px, --radius-lg 12px, --radius-full 9999px.
Shadows: --shadow-sm, --shadow-md, --shadow-lg (softer/darker variants in dark mode).
Motion: 150ms (hover), 250ms (modal/drawer). Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
Breakpoints: sm 640, md 768, lg 1024, xl 1280, 2xl 1536.
4.5 Z-index scale
base 0 • sticky header 100 • sidebar 200 • dropdown 300 • modal 400 • toast 500 • network/offline banner 600.
