AppLayout details
Sidebar: logo, navigation items (generated from route + permission config, not hardcoded), collapsible, drawer on mobile. Items without permission are hidden.
Top header: page title/breadcrumb, global search (command palette, shortcut Ctrl/Cmd + K), network indicator icon, notification bell with unread count, theme toggle, user menu (profile, timezone, logout).
Announcement strip: active announcements shown in the "display line" under the header (dismissible, by priority color).
Content area: max width container, consistent page header (title + actions).
6. Landing Page & Route Guards (UI)
Landing: hero section, features overview, Login button, Terms and Privacy links.
Logged-in user opening the landing page or login page is redirected to the dashboard (PublicRoute).
Not logged in: redirected to login (PrivateRoute).
No permission: friendly 403 page (PermissionRoute). Unknown URL: 404 page.
