11. Date, Time & Content Rules
All times displayed in the user's timezone; DB value is UTC ISO. Use formatters from client/src/core/time/ only.
Show relative time for recent items ("5 min ago") with exact time in a tooltip.
All UI text goes through a constants/config layer so labels are not scattered (ready for translation later).
12. Icons & Imagery
One icon library (e.g. Lucide) used everywhere; icon + label for important actions.
Logo and favicon from UI UX Design/08-icons-logo/; provide light and dark variants.
User profile images and icons are served from Cloudinary (Exam portal/System/user-profile).
13. Responsive Rules
Mobile: sidebar becomes a drawer, tables become card lists or horizontally scroll, toasts stay upper-right but full-width on small screens.
Touch targets at least 40px.
Dashboard grid collapses to 1 column on mobile.
14. Accessibility Checklist
Color contrast AA in both themes.
All interactive elements reachable by keyboard; visible focus ring using --color-primary.
Modals trap focus and close with Esc.
Icons-only buttons have aria-label; form fields have labels and error association.
Toasts use aria-live.
15. Rules for the Agent
Do not invent new colors, fonts or component styles. Use tokens and the components in this file.
If a design image exists in UI UX Design/ for the screen, follow it exactly.
If something is not covered here or in the images, ask the owner before designing it.
Reuse existing components. Create a new component only when none fits, and add it to section 7.
Update this file (and the image reference table) whenever the owner approves a design change.
